## 四、数据流：一张卡牌的完整生命周期

### 第一阶段：初始化

```
游戏启动
    ↓
CardsModule.initialize()
    ↓
CardManager.load_database("card_database.tres")
    ↓
数据库加载 → CardData 列表
    ↓
CardManager._build_initial_deck()
    ↓
for each CardData in database:
    repeat CardData.quantity times:
        Card.create(CardData, instance_id)  →  Card 实例
        _all_cards.append(card)               →  进入容器
    ↓
_shuffle_deck()  →  随机打乱所有 DECK 阶段的卡牌
    ↓
CardsModule._effect_registry.register(AttackHandler.new())
CardsModule._effect_registry.register(DefenseHandler.new())
...
CardsModule._effect_registry.register(BuffHandler.new())
```

### 第二阶段：回合开始

```
游戏主循环
    ↓
CardsModule.start_turn()
    ↓
CardManager.start_turn(cards_to_draw=3)
    ↓
_draw_one() × 3（或直到手牌满）
    ↓
每张卡：
    card.stage = Card.Stage.HAND
    EventBus.fire("cards:card_drawn", {...})
    ↓
EventBus.fire("cards:turn_started", {"hand_size": N})
    ↓
DrawDriver.start()  →  开始发牌驱动
```

### 第三阶段：玩家出牌

```
玩家点击某张手牌（或触发其他出牌逻辑）
    ↓
CardsModule.play_card(card)
    ↓
CardManager.play_card(card)
    ↓
card.stage = Card.Stage.PLAYING
    ↓
EventBus.fire("cards:request_rhythm_start", {
    "card_instance_id": card.instance_id,
    "rhythm_keys": card.data.rhythm_keys,
    "rhythm_timeout": card.data.rhythm_timeout,
    ...
})
    ↓
RhythmPort 监听 → rhythm_axis 收到请求
```

### 第四阶段：rhythm context 建立（FIX-9 关键路径）

```
rhythm_axis 启动节奏轴，生成 context_id
    ↓
rhythm_axis.fire("rhythm:context_started", {
    "context_id": "ctx_12345",
    "card_instance_id": "card_000000001"
})
    ↓
RhythmPort._on_context_started() 接收
    ↓
CardManager.find_card("card_000000001")  →  找到 Card
    ↓
CardManager.register_rhythm_context("ctx_12345", card)
    ↓
_playing_by_context["ctx_12345"] = card  →  O(1) 查找表建立
    card.rhythm_context_id = "ctx_12345"  →  Card 上也记录一份
```

### 第五阶段：节奏轴判定

```
玩家按节奏按下按键
    ↓
rhythm_axis 判定：Perfect / Good / Miss
    ↓
rhythm_axis.fire("rhythm:input_judged", {
    "context_id": "ctx_12345",
    "result": JUDGE_PERFECT(1),
    "delta": 0.03
})
    ↓
RhythmPort._on_rhythm_judged() 接收
    ↓
CardManager.notify_judged("ctx_12345", JUDGE_PERFECT, 0.03)
    ↓
# O(1) 查找：
card = _playing_by_context.get("ctx_12345")
    ↓
card.add_charge(1)  →  current_charge: 1/3
    ↓
EventBus.fire("cards:charge_updated", {...})
    ↓
# 继续按键...
# PERFECT: 1+1+1 = 3/3
# 或 GOOD: 1+1+1 = 3/3
# 或 MISS: charge 不增加
```

### 第六阶段：充能完成

```
card.is_fully_charged() == true
    ↓
CardManager._complete_card(card, "ctx_12345")
    ↓
card.stage = Card.Stage.CHARGED
_playing_by_context.erase("ctx_12345")
    ↓
EventBus.fire("cards:request_rhythm_stop", {"context_id": "ctx_12345"})
    ↓
EventBus.fire("cards:card_charged", {"card": card})
    ↓
CardsModule._on_card_charged() 接收
    ↓
_combo_tracker.record(card)        →  连携检测
    ↓
_effect_registry.execute(card)    →  效果触发（FIX-4 关键！）
    ↓
EffectHandler.execute() 发出 cards:effect_triggered
    ↓
EffectUsed 场景中的响应：UI 更新、动画播放、伤害计算...
```

### 第七阶段：回合结束

```
游戏主循环
    ↓
CardsModule.end_turn()
    ↓
CardManager.end_turn()
    ↓
for card in get_cards_by_stage(Card.Stage.HAND):
    card.stage = Card.Stage.DISCARD  →  未打出的卡进入弃牌堆
    ↓
EventBus.fire("cards:turn_ended", {"discard_size": N})
    ↓
# 下回合 start_turn() 时
_draw_one()
    ↓
# 如果牌堆空了
_refill_deck_from_discard()
    ↓
# 把所有 DISCARD 阶段的卡牌
# stage → DECK
# _shuffle_deck()
EventBus.fire("cards:deck_refilled", {"count": N})
```

